{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_spst_08-04",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "spst_08-04",
  "title": "Burnt Fragment 4",
  "storyCode": "EG-4",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_08-04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dc46ff94a791bf0882e1decc426833ff60b49454dd29688e36a11518996e2bf1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey. What's the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not too good. There's only a couple of devils left on the lower level..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But they're all battle-hardened mercenaries, and horrible at that. Give them a single screw, and they'd come up with a hundred ways to kill you with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In terms of combat ability, we're about even. In terms of numbers, we've only got half theirs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Uh, do you have a but? I'm gonna lose all the feeling in my legs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah. 'But' the mercs are having some interteam strife. At least the bunch outside are. The ones below us right now, I'm not too sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know that's not good news, right? Ugh, ow... that guy just now was a ruthless bastard..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you've done emergency treatment, you're good. Think of something else for now, distract yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It's gotten hotter and hotter up above. Ever since just now, the action up there's gotten a little scary... and, uh, well, how do I put it? Makes it a little hard to breathe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I said distract yourself, not think about it all!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Amiya. Amiya's alright, isn't she? And that Lungmen officer. Uh, I only met her once... but when I think about how they're dealing with... with... uh, what was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Give it a rest, you're starting to talk in tongues. Actually, you've lost plenty of blood—hold on, we've got news."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's me. I'm nearly at ground level—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What's the situation? The enemy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stroke of good luck. The Arts explosion just now at the top of the tower was like a volcano erupting. Engulfed the floor we were holding. We dispatched a few sentries in all the chaos, and the rest of them had to evacuate down to open ground—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought they'd be defending this place to the death..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe they all had a premonition of sorts. They all know, what's going on up there is beyond any 'tactical' level of foresight now—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait... what's going on! ?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wha—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grab on to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait... the—the fire's spreading?! What the hell's even flammable here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "High heat... It's just like the intel said, this is Talulah's doing...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Quit standing there! What do we do now?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh—let's go this way, join up with everyone else! Wait up, is your leg okay now?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Distracting myself!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Confirm all comms! For the time being, no casualties!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Calm your hustle. Those mercs haven't gone far. They're confirming the situation, prying for opportunities..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Command tower got caught up in a sudden explosion at the top, and now it's fallen into... momentary peace."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What part of this screams peace to you?! A—Amiya's group are okay, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm... well, with that going on at the tower top, I'd say we're practically the picture of peace."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "F... finally—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't drop your guard, we're still—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W—why'd you go mute? Hello—?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's so interesting about the sky? Is something going on at the tower...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Wait, i—is that an... orb of light? A ball... a ball of fire? A halo? What IS that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Arts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah! I've been making a record. Since the start, that first huge sound, the flames and heated airstreams have burst through the building's dome. From beneath the tower, to the naked eye, it looks like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Like the afterglow of the setting sun.\nLike the death of Infected as successive as the waves.\nLike rage.\nLike this city placed in ruin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I don't think I'm particularly perceptive compared to the rest of you, but I know more or less what you want to say here, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That'd be the leader of Reunion's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heat and flame."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But heat and flame... shouldn't be things so fearful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm. That ball of light. That's one... two people's. No, perhaps even more than that, even more rage..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So that's... Talulah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It isn't. Or put another way, it's not just her. Not by far. Everyone knows the leader of Reunion as the intel described her, but I can't draw a line between that young little dragon and what I'm seeing now at all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just what... just what happened up there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is there anyone else in the command tower?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then we need to go help them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait! Keep your head down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Enemies have left the command tower! Go find them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Block this place off. Don't give them the chance to seek aid."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh—what do we do now?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe we should go back and help Amiya—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Only Amiya... Only Amiya can do this. She can. I'm sure of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I believe in her. That's the only reason I have for standing here now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And she promised me. On my next paid leave, she'd tag along with me to hit the streets... and no leader's allowed to eat their words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then until Amiya comes back clutching victory, we can't relinquish the control tower. At the very least, we hold on until Dr. Kal'tsit arrives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh—wait, something's cutting the sky apart! Uh, that—whatever that is!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Did you hear that! ? It happened again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...A sword? Right, that Lungmen officer's a sword-wielder, isn't she..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "C-Could a sword do this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'll hold the mercs off outside the control tower. You guys, back in. Rescue the remaining people. Secure an evacuation route that hasn't been destroyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are you gonna hold alone against that many Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll go with her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You guys, go back in now. Move."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Rhodes doesn't have many left. Tell the other teams to haul the net in. We'll be going this way..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Crash their defensive line ASAP. Their deaths will be our greatest bargaining chips."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Alright!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't you push it now! They've got a lot of people!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_088",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It's been forever. Us two, fighting side by side, eyeing for a chance to ambush the enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The two battle-hardened Operators hold tight their weapons in mutual rapport, and the Sarkazs' press on towards them menacingly.\nNeither side takes their eyes off the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...For sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_089",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So about your vacation. You two still need a bag-carrier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
